window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Clio Farren</b> is a bride in pursuit of the perfect venue for her wedding. More than that, she's searching for answers concerning her best friend's sudden death a year ago. She believes <i>Raðljóst Manor</i> holds the key to figuring it out. When Clio shuts herself in with the owner during an Arctic freeze, she unravels more secrets than she expected to in both Nikolai's manor and mind.</p> <p><b>Nikolai Trousseau</b> is an unlucky soul, bound to Earth for eternity after drinking a noxious tea millennia ago. He runs a hotel in the Arctic, where polar night liberates him three months each year. With his stash of demon blood running out and a beautiful, uniquely scented woman poking around his manor, he may discover more thrumming through her veins than he bargained for.</p>"; 
